  user_input {
    user_response: "Description for Gemini App Builder\"Build an expert Cambridge IGCSE Geography (0460) Coursework Moderator app.Its primary purpose is to analyze student coursework drafts (approx. 2000 words) based on the \'Route to Geographical Enquiry\' framework. The app must evaluate work across five assessment criteria, each worth 12 marks (60 total):  Knowledge and understanding (AO1).  Observation and collection of primary data (AO2).  Organisation and presentation of data (AO2), requiring at least two complex techniques.  Analysis and interpretation (AO2).  Conclusion and Evaluation (AO3).  The app should use a \'Best Fit\' marking method. When a draft is uploaded, it must provide annotated feedback for each criterion, suggest concrete steps to move from Level 2 to Level 3 (like adding complex graphs or justifying sampling), and provide an indicative score out of 60 based on the 2027 standards.\""
