    thinking: "**Developing the Moderation App**\n\nI\'m currently focused on building the framework for the Geography coursework moderation app. My primary objective is a web application allowing users to upload drafts. I\'m focusing on the core structure for the 5 key criteria evaluations (A01-A03), and I am structuring the system with a design to allow integration of different AI-based evaluations of the assessment criteria.\n\n\n**Building the API Structure**\n\nI\'m now establishing the application\'s API structure. I\'ve defined the frontend components: text area/file upload for draft submission, and an output section to display the results. On the backend, I\'m working on the Express server with an `/api/evaluate` endpoint using the Gemini API for evaluation. I\'ll focus on the data exchange structure, initially a structured JSON response to hold feedback, suggestions, and an indicative score. I\'ll need to update `metadata.json`, create `server.ts` and update `package.json`. Then, I\'ll work on the frontend design in `src/App.tsx`.\n\n\n"
