-8 bg-white border-b border-slate-200 shrink-0\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 rounded flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold\\\">C</div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-800 underline decoration-blue-500 underline-offset-4\\\">Cambridge IGCSE 0460 Moderator</h1>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 rounded-full border border-blue-100 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">2027 Standards Active</span>\\n      <button class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-md text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors\\\">New Moderation</button>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"flex flex-1 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <!-- Left Navigation: Assessment Framework -->\\n    <nav class=\\\"w-64 bg-slate-100 border-r border-slate-200 flex flex-col p-4 shrink-0\\\">\\n      <p class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4\\\">Assessment Criteria</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center p-2 rounded bg-white shadow-sm border border-slate-200\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs font-medium\\\">AO1: Knowledge</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-blue-600\\\">9/12</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center p-2 rounded bg-slate-50 border border-transparent\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-600\\\">AO2: Observation</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400\\\">8/12</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center p-2 rounded bg-white shadow-sm border border-slate-200 ring-1 ring-blue-500/20\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs font-medium\\\">AO2: Organisation</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-blue-600\\\">7/12</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center p-2 rounded bg-slate-50 border border-transparent\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-600\\\">AO2: Analysis</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400\\\">10/12</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center p-2 rounded bg-slate-50 border border-transparent\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-600\\\">AO3: Conclusion</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400\\\">8/12</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-auto bg-blue-900 rounded-xl p-4 text-white\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"text-xs opacity-80 mb-1\\\">Indicative Total</p>\\n        <h2 class=\\\"text-3xl font-bold\\\">42<span class=\\\"text-sm font-normal opacity-60\\\">/60</span></h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[10px] mt-2 bg-white/10 px-2 py-1 rounded inline-block\\\">Grade Threshold: Solid B / Entry A</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <!-- Central View: Document Content & Annotations -->\\n    <section class=\\\"flex-1 bg-slate-200/50 flex flex-col relative\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute top-4 left-4 right-4 bg-white shadow-lg rounded-lg border border-slate-300 h-[650px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"p-6 border-b border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n          <h3 class=\\\"font-serif text-xl italic\\\">Investigating the impact of Tourism on the CBD of Stratford-upon-Avon</h3>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">Draft_v2.docx (1,842 words)</span>\\n        </div>\\n        \\n        <div class=\\\"p-8 flex flex-col gap-6 font-serif text-slate-700 leading-relaxed overflow-hidden opacity-60\\\">\\n          <p>The aim of this enquiry is to determine whether the tourism sector provides a net benefit to the urban environment. Data was collected on March 12th using a systematic sampling technique...</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"relative bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-400 p-4 -mx-2\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-sm text-blue-900 font-sans font-medium mb-1 uppercase tracking-tighter\\\">Annotation: AO2 Organisation</p>\\n            <p class=\\\"italic\\\">\\\"The candidate has presented a simple bar chart of pedestrian counts. To reach Level 3, at least two complex techniques are required (e.g. Isoline maps, Chi-squared, or Spearman\342\200\231s Rank).\\\"</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <p>Table 1 shows the results of the questionnaire. 45% of respondents indicated that parking was the primary concern. Figure 2 shows the location of tourist attractions relative to transit hubs...</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"relative bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-400 p-4 -mx-2\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-sm text-amber-900 font-sans font-medium mb-1 uppercase tracking-tighter\\\">Annotation: AO3 Evaluation</p>\\n            <p class=\\\"italic\\\">\\\"Limitations are identified, but no specific improvements are suggested for the sampling method. Justify why 50 people was an adequate sample size.\\\"</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Right Sidebar: Level Up Feedback -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-80 bg-white border-l border-slate-200 flex flex-col p-5 shrink-0\\\">\\n      <h4 class=\\\"text-sm font-bold border-b border-slate-100 pb-3 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-500\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\"><path d=\\\"M11 3a1 1 0 10-2 0v1a1 1 0 102 0V3zM15.657 5.757a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414l-.707.707a1 1 0 001.414 1.414l.707-.707zM18 10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-1a1 1 0 110-2h1a1 1 0 011 1zM5.05 6.464A1 1 0 106.464 5.05l-.707-.707a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l.707.707zM5 10a1 1 0 01-1 1H3a1 1 0 110-2h1a1 1 0 011 1zM8 16v-1a1 1 0 112 0v1a1 1 0 11-2 0zM13.536 14.95a1 1 0 011.414 0l.707.707a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414l-.707-.707a1 1 0 010-1.414zM16.243 17.243a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414l-.707-.707a1 1 0 011.414-1.414l.707.707z\\\"></path></svg>\\n        Level 2 to Level 3 Roadmap\\n      </h4>\\n      \\n      <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold text-blue-600 uppercase mb-1\\\">Data Presentation</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600\\\">Replace basic tally charts with a <strong>Bipolar Environmental Quality Survey</strong> or a <strong>Desire Line Map</strong> to show movement patterns.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold text-blue-600 uppercase mb-1\\\">Data Collection</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600\\\">Provide a <strong>rigorous justification</strong> for your stratified sampling. Why choose those specific 5 sites?</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[11px] font-bold text-blue-600 uppercase mb-1\\\">Analysis</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600\\\">Link results back to specific <strong>Geographical Theories</strong> (e.g. Burgess Model or Butler\342\200\231s TALC model).</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-slate-100\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-bold tracking-widest mb-3\\\">Best Fit Moderation Log</p>\\n        <ul class=\\\"text-[11px] space-y-2 text-slate-500\\\">\\n          <li class=\\\"flex items-start gap-2\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 mt-1\\\"></div>\\n            AO1: Demonstrates clear conceptual grasp.\\n          </li>\\n          <li class=\\\"flex items-start gap-2\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 mt-1\\\"></div>\\n            AO2: Complex techniques missing for L3.\\n          </li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- Footer Status -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-8 px-6 bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] uppercase tracking-tighter\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-4\\\">\\n      <span>Session ID: MOD-0460-2027-8821</span>\\n      <span>Auto-save: 2 minutes ago</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-2 items-center\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-400 animate-pulse\\\"></div>\\n      <span>AI Engine: Route-to-Enquiry v4.2</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
