  user_input {
    user_response: "Okay so in the folder directory, navigable from the main screen it should load an empty area where folders can be created. As you can see here I have created 3 folders for our 3 IB teachers, this is inside my folder SKN, IA 2026 assignment. \n\nNotice how I have taken two screenshots that show a number of observable features to the teacher. E.g. the IAQA score and TEACHER score (sometimes different) where teacher has self moderated the score by criterion. Then in the second screenshot, I have navigated from draft to final. Notice how it prompts the user to then upload the students FINAL IA (in this case) it will be Upload Final CWK. Notice how Ziniu Yu\'s final has been entered in it\'s entirety. Draft report and final report for Louis can be accessed from this screen. \n\nWhen entered the draft report shows as before with Melissa. \n\nBut look how Louis\'s final report places draft and final side by side as a comparison. Also notice how still in the final report, the TEACHER criterion entry is still editable to the teacher."
    items {
      text: "Okay so in the folder directory, navigable from the main screen it should load an empty area where folders can be created. As you can see here I have created 3 folders for our 3 IB teachers, this is inside my folder SKN, IA 2026 assignment. \n\nNotice how I have taken two screenshots that show a number of observable features to the teacher. E.g. the IAQA score and TEACHER score (sometimes different) where teacher has self moderated the score by criterion. Then in the second screenshot, I have navigated from draft to final. Notice how it prompts the user to then upload the students FINAL IA (in this case) it will be Upload Final CWK. Notice how Ziniu Yu\'s final has been entered in it\'s entirety. Draft report and final report for Louis can be accessed from this screen. \n\nWhen entered the draft report shows as before with Melissa. \n\nBut look how Louis\'s final report places draft and final side by side as a comparison. Also notice how still in the final report, the TEACHER criterion entry is still editable to the teacher."
    }
