    thinking: "**Constructing DirectoryView Logic**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the `DirectoryView` component, starting with `/src/components/DirectoryView.tsx`. My current thought process revolves around the element display within the directory, as well as its overall functionality, with the key being navigation. The goal is a navigable directory, as the initial step in the project.\n\n\n**Visualizing Data Display**\n\nI\'m now thinking about how to visualize the data, considering the user\'s need to see both drafts and final reports. The side-by-side comparison is a critical feature. I\'m also planning to implement an app state variable in `App.tsx` and map out how this will work with the directory view data display.\n\n\n**Analyzing Teacher Score Edits**\n\nI\'m now diving into the teacher score editing functionality within `ModerationResults`. My initial thought was that the teacher mark was editable, as the final report indicates. However, I see it\'s currently a `span`, so not directly editable. I need to figure out how to make this interactive. The `IGQA` score, however, will be displayed.\n\n\n"
